meta {
  name: Get Client App Settings
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/client/settings
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Locale: ru
}

docs {
  # Get Client App Settings

  Public endpoint. No auth.

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": {
      "content": "<h1>Правила</h1><p>...</p>",
      "master_call_out_fee_note": "Если отмените после выезда мастера — оплатите выезд.",
      "order_urgency_fee": 20,
      "order_urgency_fee_note": "Срочный вызов без даты и слота. К сумме добавится 20 TMT.",
      "order_cancel_fee": 15,
      "order_cancel_fee_note": "Если мастер уже начал работу, при отмене нужно оплатить 15 TMT.",
      "time_slots": ["08-10", "10-12", "12-14", "14-16", "16-18", "18-20"]
    }
  }
  ```

  | Field | Use in app |
  |---|---|
  | `content` | HTML rules / T&C (WebView) |
  | `master_call_out_fee_note` | Text warning when cancelling after master assigned (cash call-out). Hide if `""` |
  | `order_urgency_fee` | Show on «Срочно» toggle — fee added to urgent order |
  | `order_urgency_fee_note` | Free-text urgency notice from admin (ru/tk via `X-Locale`). Hide if `""` |
  | `order_cancel_fee` | Show on cancel confirmation **only if** order status is `in_progress`. Snapshotted onto order as `cancel_fee` when cancelled from that status; otherwise cancel is free (`cancel_fee: null`) |
  | `order_cancel_fee_note` | Free-text cancel notice from admin (ru/tk via `X-Locale`). Hide if `""` |
  | `time_slots` | Values for schedule picker (`"08-10"` …). Display as `08:00 - 10:00` |

  Locale: `X-Locale: ru` | `tk` (affects `content`, `master_call_out_fee_note`, `order_urgency_fee_note`, `order_cancel_fee_note`).
}
